#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:6
msgid "Quick Categories"
msgstr "快速分类"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:7
msgid ""
"Data movement: `T.copy`, `T.async_copy`, `T.c2d_im2col`, staging Global ↔ "
"Shared ↔ Fragment"
msgstr ""
"数据搬运：`T.copy`、`T.async_copy`、`T.c2d_im2col`，在 Global ↔ "
"Shared ↔ Fragment 之间传递数据"

