#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:165
msgid "Compute primitives"
msgstr "计算原语"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:166
msgid "`T.gemm(A_s, B_s, C_f)`: Tile GEMM into fragment accumulator."
msgstr "`T.gemm(A_s, B_s, C_f)`：Tile GEMM，结果写入片段累加器。"

