msgstr ""
"逐元素数学运算：TIR 运算（`T.exp`、`T.log`、`T.max`、`T.min`、`T.rsqrt` 等）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:172
msgid ""
"Fast math: `T.__log/__log2/__log10/__exp/__exp2/__exp10/__sin/__cos/__tan`."
msgstr ""
"快速数学：`T.__log/__log2/__log10/__exp/__exp2/__exp10/__sin/__cos/__tan`。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:173
msgid "IEEE math: `T.ieee_add/sub/mul/fmaf` (configurable rounding)."
msgstr "IEEE 数学：`T.ieee_add/sub/mul/fmaf`（可配置的舍入方式）。"

