msgstr "`T.annotate_layout({...})`：为缓冲区附加显式布局。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:187
msgid "`T.annotate_safe_value(var, ...)`: Safety/const hints."
msgstr "`T.annotate_safe_value(var, ...)`：安全性/常量提示。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:188
msgid "`T.annotate_l2_hit_ratio(buf, ratio)`: Cache behavior hint."
msgstr "`T.annotate_l2_hit_ratio(buf, ratio)`：缓存行为提示。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:190
msgid "Synchronization helpers"
msgstr "同步辅助函数"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:191
msgid ""
"`T.sync_threads([barrier_id, arrive_count])`: Block-wide barrier "
"(`__syncthreads()`)."
msgstr ""
"`T.sync_threads([barrier_id, arrive_count])`：块级屏障（`__syncthreads()`）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:192
msgid "`T.sync_warp([mask])`: Warp-wide barrier (`__syncwarp([mask])`)."
msgstr "`T.sync_warp([mask])`：Warp 级屏障（`__syncwarp([mask])`）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:193
msgid ""
"`T.sync_grid()`: Cooperative grid barrier (requires cooperative launch)."
msgstr ""
"`T.sync_grid()`：协作 Grid 屏障（需要配合 cooperative launch 使用）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:194
msgid ""
"`T.pdl_trigger()`: Signal programmatic launch completion for the current "
"kernel."
msgstr ""
"`T.pdl_trigger()`：发出当前内核的编程式启动完成信号。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:195
msgid "`T.pdl_sync()`: Wait until kernel dependencies are satisfied."
msgstr "`T.pdl_sync()`：等待直到内核依赖关系得以满足。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:197
msgid "Warp-vote / warp-ballot (CUDA ≥ 9 / HIP)"
msgstr "Warp 投票 / Warp 表决（CUDA ≥ 9 / HIP）"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:198
msgid ""
"`T.any_sync(predicate[, mask])` → `int32`: Non-zero if ANY lane in `mask` "
"has non-zero predicate (`__any_sync`). `mask` defaults to `0xFFFFFFFF`."
msgstr ""
"`T.any_sync(predicate[, mask])` → `int32`：如果 `mask` 中任一通道具有非零"
"谓词，则返回非零值（`__any_sync`）。`mask` 默认为 `0xFFFFFFFF`。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:199
msgid ""
"`T.all_sync(predicate[, mask])` → `int32`: Non-zero if ALL lanes in `mask` "
"have non-zero predicate (`__all_sync`). `mask` defaults to `0xFFFFFFFF`."
msgstr ""
"`T.all_sync(predicate[, mask])` → `int32`：如果 `mask` 中所有通道都具有非零"
"谓词，则返回非零值（`__all_sync`）。`mask` 默认为 `0xFFFFFFFF`。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:200
msgid ""
"`T.ballot_sync(predicate[, mask])` → `uint64`: Bitmask of lanes in `mask` "
"with non-zero predicate. CUDA: `__ballot_sync` zero-extended to 64 bits; "
"HIP: `__ballot` returns natively as `uint64`, covering all 64 wavefront "
"lanes. `mask` defaults to `0xFFFFFFFF`."
msgstr ""
"`T.ballot_sync(predicate[, mask])` → `uint64`：`mask` 中具有非零谓词的通道"
"位掩码。CUDA：`__ballot_sync` 零扩展至 64 位；HIP：`__ballot` 原生返回 "
"`uint64`，覆盖全部 64 个 wavefront 通道。`mask` 默认为 `0xFFFFFFFF`。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:201
msgid ""
"`T.ballot(predicate)` → `uint64`: Full-warp/wavefront ballot (mask = "
"`0xFFFFFFFF`). No truncation on HIP."
msgstr ""
"`T.ballot(predicate)` → `uint64`：全 Warp/Wavefront 表决（mask = "
"`0xFFFFFFFF`）。HIP 上不会截断。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:202
msgid ""
"`T.activemask()` → `uint64`: Bitmask of currently active lanes. CUDA: "
"`__activemask` zero-extended to 64 bits; HIP: `__ballot(1)` as `uint64`."
msgstr ""
"`T.activemask()` → `uint64`：当前活跃通道的位掩码。CUDA：`__activemask` "
"零扩展至 64 位；HIP：`__ballot(1)` 作为 `uint64`。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:204
msgid "Block-wide predicated sync"
msgstr "块级谓词同步"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:205
msgid ""
"`T.syncthreads_count(predicate)` → `int32`: Sync all threads; return count "
"with non-zero predicate (`__syncthreads_count`)."
msgstr ""
"`T.syncthreads_count(predicate)` → `int32`：同步所有线程；返回具有非零谓词"
"的线程计数（`__syncthreads_count`）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:206
msgid ""
"`T.syncthreads_and(predicate)` → `int32`: Sync; non-zero iff ALL threads "
"have non-zero predicate (`__syncthreads_and`)."
msgstr ""
"`T.syncthreads_and(predicate)` → `int32`：同步；当且仅当所有线程都具有非零"
"谓词时返回非零值（`__syncthreads_and`）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:207
msgid ""
"`T.syncthreads_or(predicate)` → `int32`: Sync; non-zero iff ANY thread has "
"non-zero predicate (`__syncthreads_or`)."
msgstr ""
"`T.syncthreads_or(predicate)` → `int32`：同步；当且仅当任一线程具有非零"
"谓词时返回非零值（`__syncthreads_or`）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:209
msgid ""
"Warp-shuffle (intra-warp data exchange). All accept a trailing `mask` kwarg "
"that defaults to `0xFFFFFFFF`."
msgstr ""
"Warp 混洗（Warp 内数据交换）。所有函数均接受一个末尾的 `mask` 关键字参数，"
"默认为 `0xFFFFFFFF`。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:210
msgid ""
"`T.shfl_sync(value, src_lane[, width, mask])`: Broadcast value from "
"`src_lane` to all lanes (`__shfl_sync`)."
msgstr ""
"`T.shfl_sync(value, src_lane[, width, mask])`：将 `src_lane` 的值广播到所有通道"
"（`__shfl_sync`）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:211
msgid ""
"`T.shfl_xor(value, delta[, width, mask])`: XOR-swap across lanes "
"(`__shfl_xor_sync`)."
msgstr ""
"`T.shfl_xor(value, delta[, width, mask])`：跨通道 XOR 交换"
"（`__shfl_xor_sync`）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:212
msgid ""
"`T.shfl_down(value, delta[, width, mask])`: Shift down by `delta` lanes "
"(`__shfl_down_sync`)."
msgstr ""
"`T.shfl_down(value, delta[, width, mask])`：向下移动 `delta` 个通道"
"（`__shfl_down_sync`）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:213
msgid ""
"`T.shfl_up(value, delta[, width, mask])`: Shift up by `delta` lanes "
"(`__shfl_up_sync`)."
msgstr ""
"`T.shfl_up(value, delta[, width, mask])`：向上移动 `delta` 个通道"
"（`__shfl_up_sync`）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:215
msgid ""
"Warp-match (CUDA sm_70+, not supported on HIP). `mask` defaults to "
"`0xFFFFFFFF`."
msgstr ""
"Warp 匹配（CUDA sm_70+，HIP 不支持）。`mask` 默认为 `0xFFFFFFFF`。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:216
msgid ""
"`T.match_any_sync(value[, mask])` → `uint32`: Bitmask of lanes in `mask` "
"whose `value` matches the calling lane's (`__match_any_sync`)."
msgstr ""
"`T.match_any_sync(value[, mask])` → `uint32`：`mask` 中其 `value` 与调用"
"通道匹配的通道的位掩码（`__match_any_sync`）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:217
msgid ""
"`T.match_all_sync(value[, mask])` → `uint32`: Returns `mask` if all lanes in "
"`mask` agree on `value`, else 0 (`__match_all_sync`). The C-level `int*` "
"predicate output is hidden; reconstruct it as `result != 0`."
msgstr ""
"`T.match_all_sync(value[, mask])` → `uint32`：如果 `mask` 中所有通道在 "
"`value` 上一致，则返回 `mask`，否则返回 0（`__match_all_sync`）。C 级别的 "
"`int*` 谓词输出被隐藏；可通过 `result != 0` 来重建它。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/instructions.md:219
msgid ""
"**Note on HIP:** `any_sync`/`all_sync` ignore the mask and call `__any`/"
"`__all` directly. `ballot_sync`, `ballot`, and `activemask` call `__ballot` "
"which returns `uint64` natively on 64-thread wavefronts — no truncation "
"occurs. Shuffle intrinsics lower to `__shfl`/`__shfl_xor`/`__shfl_down`/"
"`__shfl_up` (mask ignored). `syncthreads_count/and/or` have identical "
"signatures on both platforms. `match_any_sync` and `match_all_sync` have no "
"HIP equivalent and will fail to codegen on HIP."
msgstr ""
"**HIP 注意事项：** `any_sync`/`all_sync` 忽略掩码，直接调用 `__any`/"
"`__all`。`ballot_sync`、`ballot` 和 `activemask` 调用 `__ballot`，"
"在 64 线程 wavefront 上原生返回 `uint64`——不会发生截断。混洗内建函数"
"lowering 为 `__shfl`/`__shfl_xor`/`__shfl_down`/`__shfl_up`（掩码被忽略）。"
"`syncthreads_count/and/or` 在两个平台上具有相同的签名。`match_any_sync` 和 "
"`match_all_sync` 没有 HIP 等价实现，在 HIP 上 codegen 会失败。"

